  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_39c45fe0e3394e05a8299438457db8dd",
      "statement": "MCM is a polyglot pnpm/Nx monorepo comprising a React Native/Expo universal client, a Rust/Axum domain service, a Python LangGraph agent gateway, three scoped MCP servers, shared infrastructure-as-code, and a self-hosted Forgejo CI/CD pipeline.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L1-L8",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:034b1df9ba5fca11c4530d931b734f0ee1e803639d2be75b69877a12c9e626b2:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_6d12dc1a848d4255840eedc7e11a8ab9",
      "statement": "All build, test, and lint tasks in the MCM monorepo are invoked through Nx as the universal task runner; npm/yarn and the underlying tools (cargo, pytest, etc.) are never run directly.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://CLAUDE.md#L1-L2",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:31cf2084f046cf51d860f5ec3abe85ee9732ac10140d6622dc3e4631670c5b79:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L179-L190",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:976b35eca7f3a34b295d1ed0ffc9e3b70838029a6faca076078b9b326fd13f62:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c44ea14c25774e62b4dfce9d1e2ace1c",
      "statement": "The primary AI-assisted development environment is a dev container hosted inside a Docker Sandbox microVM (feature 060), not Docker-in-Docker. Sibling containers build on the microVM's own engine and share its network namespace (`docker-outside-of-docker`, `--network=host`); egress is enforced by a deny-by-default policy outside the VM.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L138-L146",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f1181a461dc89545c316d208d573bd6d3a177e2b3b8529fa8e3e047eef48af01:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/runbooks/devcontainer-sandbox.md#L1-L12",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:276c5cdeab693441ce0ff737154f9892d269fbd1cf0af75a8efd1dd1b85df16e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5fe5250a99f846dca8e6a0ef933d4d78",
      "statement": "The sandbox microVM path measured 0.43× the wall-clock of the Docker-in-Docker path across five bring-up stages; `docker-build` alone went from 1024 s to 293 s.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L142-L143",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:58f1b2162dfce385d257bfc6b77436514e106f32c7ff253884566ea808682625:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/runbooks/devcontainer.md#L12-L14",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:df7e5d5ebc8795e4a8c5453e1a097e8a6db0845ab4a1a08ac071cedfd8cf2fec:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_04a2227f29d04f0aad32089beaf32dff",
      "statement": "The one-step entry to the sandbox dev environment is `./scripts/open-sandbox.ps1`, which runs on Windows PowerShell 5.1 (not pwsh), checks whether the sandbox is running, starts it if not, waits for SSH, and opens VS Code directly inside the dev container.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L79-L85",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bf84f0f7c41188f0caa67dda059d13ba295b536a108f82c25786e2c32ab916fe:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/runbooks/devcontainer-sandbox.md#L39-L60",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bece9a25e37ffed05f21fcc5e59c75c01a9be97230bd293eb6085b0cf71b22ad:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5d802da5dba442a8b328d3741e60ebb9",
      "statement": "The Docker Desktop / Docker-in-Docker path is retained solely for the Android emulator, which needs `/dev/kvm` that the microVM cannot provide (no nested virtualization). All other work — web E2E, integration, the agent stack, day-to-day assistant work — belongs on the sandbox.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L155-L173",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:931722407bae844b0e4afd8e8e1110533b64bd9f766422f753a22f9435753c65:"
        },
